# AI Career OS – Career Page Template v2.0 (Official Master Template)

## Purpose

This is the official master template for every Career Page inside AI Career OS.

The goal is not to create an educational article, but to build an interactive AI-powered Career Operating System that guides users from absolute beginner to job-ready professional.

Every career page must follow this template exactly to ensure consistency, scalability, premium UX, and long-term maintainability.

