* What is this career?
* Why should I learn it?
* Is it right for me?
* What will I do every day?
* How do I learn it?
* How do I practice it?
* How do I build a portfolio?
* How do I get hired?
* How do I continue growing?

Every page should feel like a complete AI Career Operating System—not a traditional educational article.
